## Log: Create variant-2-warm.html — Warm & Cozy Academic Design
**Started:** 2026-02-15

### Step 1: Read source file
- Read all 1840 lines of index.html to extract all Russian text content, sections, and structure

### Step 2: Created variant-2-warm.html
- Single HTML file with all CSS and JS inline
- Google Fonts CDN: DM Serif Display (headings) + DM Sans (body)

### Design implementation details:

**Color Palette (Light):**
- Primary background: warm cream #FFF8F0
- Accent: warm coral/terracotta #E07A5F
- Secondary accent: muted gold #D4A574
- Text: deep warm brown #2D2A26
- Cards: white #FFFFFF with warm brown-tinted shadows (rgba(139, 90, 60, 0.06))
- Secondary text: #6B6560, tertiary: #9A948E

**Color Palette (Dark):**
- Background: deep warm dark #1A1614
- Surface/cards: #2A2622
- Text: warm light #F0E6DA
- Accent: brighter coral #F08A6F
- Gold: #E0B88A

**Typography:**
- Headings: DM Serif Display (elegant serif) — used for hero name, section headings, card headings, stat numbers
- Body: DM Sans (clean modern sans) — used for all body text, labels, navigation

**Visual Style:**
- Rounded corners: 12px (small), 16px (medium), 24px (large) via CSS custom properties
- Warm shadows: rgba(139, 90, 60, ...) tint on card shadows
- Paper-like texture: SVG noise pattern via body::after with fixed positioning, 2.5% opacity
- Left accent border: 4px solid coral on all .card elements
- CIS banner has gold left border instead
- Top gradient stripe on pricing card and form wrapper

**Decorative Elements (CSS only):**
- .decor-dots: radial-gradient dot patterns (12px grid), 6% opacity
- .decor-circle: circular outlines with gold border, 8% opacity
- Hero: 4 decorative elements (2 circles, 2 dot patterns) at different positions
- Sections: scattered decorative circles and dots throughout
- All hidden on mobile (< 768px)

**Hero:**
- Full viewport with warm gradient: cream -> peach (#FFF8F0 -> #FFE8D6 -> #FFDCC8 -> #FFF0E6)
- Dark mode gradient: #1A1614 -> #2A211A -> #1E1915
- Photo circle with gradient border (coral -> gold -> light coral)
- Animated gradient shift on border (8s infinite)
- Same content: name, title, experience badge, promise, countries, CTA

**Section Layout:**
- Alternating: cream (#FFF8F0) and white (#FFFFFF)
- Section eyebrow labels in gold (#D4A574)
- Section headings in DM Serif Display

**Background Images:**
- Same Unsplash URLs as index.html
- Applied via ::before pseudo-elements
- Warm sepia-like filter: saturate(0.4) sepia(0.5)
- Dark mode: saturate(0.2) sepia(0.3) brightness(0.5)
- Mobile: background-attachment: scroll for iOS compatibility

**Animations:**
- Scroll reveal: fade-in + translateY(30px) with staggered delays
- Cards: hover translateY(-6px) with enhanced shadow
- Buttons: hover translateY(-2px) with warm glow shadow
- Hero CTA: warmGlow keyframe animation (pulsing shadow)
- Hero elements: staggered heroFadeIn animations
- FAQ: smooth accordion expand (max-height transition)
- Counter: animated count-up on scroll intersection

**Stats Section:**
- Numbers styled with DM Serif Display in coral accent color
- Each stat in its own rounded card with shadow
- Hover lift effect

**Steps Section:**
- Connecting gradient line (coral -> gold -> coral) between step numbers
- Step numbers in gradient circles (coral -> gold)
- Hidden connecting line on mobile

**Form:**
- Gradient top stripe (coral -> gold -> coral)
- Warm cream background on inputs
- Coral focus ring (box-shadow)
- Coral validation highlight color

**Responsive:**
- Header: frosted glass with warm cream tint
- Mobile hamburger menu with slide-down animation
- All grids collapse to fewer/single columns
- Decorative elements hidden on mobile
- Reduced section padding on smaller screens

**JavaScript:**
- Separate localStorage key (theme-preference-warm) to not conflict with main variant
- All same functionality: theme toggle, header scroll, mobile nav, scroll reveal, counter animation, FAQ accordion, hero parallax, form handler

### Verification:
- All Russian text content matches index.html exactly
- All sections present: Hero, Audience, Stats, About, Steps, Method, Format, Types, Pricing, Reviews, FAQ, Form, Contacts, Footer
- All 6 FAQ items with same questions and answers
- Form with same 4 fields and same goal options
- Same contact information (phone numbers, email)
- Dark mode with toggle
- Mobile responsive with hamburger menu

**Completed:** 2026-02-15
